    "Ticker hierarchy: series (CONTROLH) > event (CONTROLH-2026) > market (CONTROLH-2026-D). Site URLs /markets/{series}/{slug}/{event} map to these, uppercased.",
    "Prices: integer fields (yes_bid, last_price) are cents (0-100 = implied % probability); *_dollars fields are the same price as dollar strings.",
    "close_date is when trading stops; expiration_date / expected_expiration_time is when the market settles and pays out.",
    "All data is public; no login needed."
